# Twilio for outbound PSTN (callback bridge).
# Copy these into the API process environment. Spring does not load this file.
# Do not commit real values. Do not paste them into the app.
#
# Required to place a call:
#   TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID
#   TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN
#   TWILIO_PUBLIC_BASE_URL   public https origin of this API (bridge and status webhooks)
#
# Optional caller ID when the firm has not saved a number in the app:
#   TWILIO_VOICE_FROM        E.164 number this account already owns or has verified
#
# No IncomingPhoneNumber purchase is required.
# No South Africa End-User / regulatory bundle is required for this outbound path.
# After a Twilio account leaves trial, the free trial From number is gone.
# Verify a personal mobile or landline in the app, or set TWILIO_VOICE_FROM.
# Automatic caller ID order is documented in the repository README
# (rented DID, then in-app verified personal number, then TWILIO_VOICE_FROM,
# then an IncomingPhoneNumber already on the account, then a verified Outgoing Caller ID).

TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=
TWILIO_VOICE_FROM=
